{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15063","headline":"赋得西戎献白玉环 · 李竦","name":"赋得西戎献白玉环","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当时无外守，方物四夷通。\n列土金河北，朝天玉塞东。\n自将荆璞比，不与郑环同。\n正朔虽传汉，衣冠尚带戎。\n幸承提佩宠，多媿琢磨功。\n绝域知文教，争趋上国风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李竦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}